/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 444 0 R
/E (The AI Customer Support Ticket Triage system provides an intelligent approach for automatically analyzing, classifying, prioritizing, and routing customer support tickets. By combining Artificial Intelligence, Natural Language Processing, and Machine Learning, the system can understand customer messages and identify important information such as ticket category, priority, urgency, and sentiment.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
248 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 445 0 R
/E (The system reduces the manual effort involved in ticket management and helps support teams identify critical issues quickly. Its smart routing, duplicate detection, confidence scoring, and interactive dashboard features improve the efficiency of customer-support operations.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
249 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 446 0 R
/E (Overall, the proposed system can help organizations reduce response time, improve ticket management, distribute workload effectively, and provide a better customer experience. Future enhancements such as multilingual processing, voice analysis, generative AI, SLA prediction, and CRM integration can further improve its capabilities.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
